---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="About Reeltotranscript — Reeltotranscript" description="How Reeltotranscript turns short-form video into text and timed captions." canonicalPath="/about">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-5 py-16 leading-relaxed">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold">About Reeltotranscript</h1>
    <section class="my-6"><h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold">For creators and editors</h2><p>Use a transcript to quote a speaker, prepare show notes or draft captions. Save the result as plain text, SRT or VTT.</p></section>
    <section class="my-6"><h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold">How it works</h2><p>Our server retrieves a public clip or accepts your upload and uses Whisper to transcribe the speech. Each signed-in account can complete three transcriptions per day.</p></section>
    <a class="underline" href="mailto:hello@reeltotranscript.com">hello@reeltotranscript.com</a>
  </article>
</Layout>
